+# Patch Notes — 5.2.0
+
+This patch changes the ownership provider, not the persistent collection format.
+
+## Removed from normal sync
+
+- Collection screen selection
+- Card-grid scrolling
+- Screenshot calibration
+- OCR
+- Quantity-diamond detection
