-"""Tolerant MTG Arena ``Player.log`` collection importer.
-
-Arena has emitted the collection in several shapes over time: a direct numeric
-map, an escaped JSON payload inside a response envelope, and arrays of card
-objects.  This module intentionally keeps that format handling isolated from the
-GUI and persistent database so a future Arena logging change is a small parser
-update rather than an application rewrite.
