--- **One persistent collection.** Visual and log scans merge into `collection.db` rather than appending duplicate exports.
--- **Safe quantity updates.** Higher quantities update a saved printing; lower readings are held for review instead of silently reducing the collection.
--- **Four-diamond quantity reader.** Each Arena ownership diamond is classified independently as filled, empty, or uncertain.
