-"""Visual collection scanning for MTG Arena.
-
-The visual scanner captures the visible MTG Arena client, waits for the card grid
-to stop moving, distinguishes a new collection view from hover/foil animation or
-a duplicate revisit, OCRs each accepted card tile, and exports only confirmed
-records. Uncertain reads are preserved for review instead of being guessed.
-
-Windows-only capture dependencies are imported lazily so the rest of the app can
-still start and explain missing setup cleanly.
-"""
